# The corpora under data/ are DATA, not source. Their exact bytes are part of
# the experiment: data/README.md records a sha256 for each, and the token
# stream a model sees depends on them. Git's autocrlf would rewrite line
# endings on checkout, so a fresh clone would hash differently and tokenize
# differently from the files these results were measured on.
#
# -text disables all line-ending conversion for them. Do not remove this.
data/*.txt -text

# Figures are binary; diffing them is noise.
*.png binary
